      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay but i'm really trying to avoid the doctor. if i just take some strong ibuprofen and do some really deep, intense spinal twists to \"unblock\" the nerve, can i just manage this at home for a few days? what's the safest way to do the stretches so i don't make it worse?",
